<!--
NOTES:
the inertial values need to be added and tuned on this thing.
This is not accurate to real life in the slightest because the inertia quaternions are not filled out...
On the note of inertial reference frames, we need to figure out how those will work with componenets adding onto each other...

Multiple links are being used even though the body is comprised of multiple shapes that are statically connected.
The reason this is being done is because having all those shapes and collisions being fused together in one ridged
body would require for some nasty parralell axis theorum problems in order to calculate inertia tensor for the link.
The compute used for this small change is miniscule and I dont want to do the calculations -Chris Teggatz
-->
